        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "If someone wants a different approach (maybe more modular):\r\n```lua\r\n    local disabled_filetypes = { 'NvimTree', 'alpha', 'help' }\r\n    vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('FileType', {\r\n      group = vim.api.nvim_create_augroup('MiniIndentScopeDisable', { clear = true }),\r\n      callback = function(opts)\r\n        local ftype = vim.bo[opts.buf].filetype\r\n        if vim.tbl_contains(disabled_filetypes, ftype) then\r\n          vim.b.miniindentscope_disable = true\r\n        end\r\n      end,\r\n    })\r\n```",
            "created_at": "2024-06-12T21:18:15Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/144#issuecomment-2163918793",
